[{"title":"荆山","author":"汪广洋","text":"荆山有玉名天下，玉去山存县治幽。\n九涧直从松顶落，八河旁绕石根流。\n椒花委路东风歇，云气弥空紫盖浮。\n兵后可伤民物尽，几家星散住林陬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53682,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次涂山拜禹王庙","author":"汪广洋","text":"尧舜深嗟浲水流，禹王专任八年忧。\n力排汉泗归溟壑，威逐龙蛇出海陬。\n胼胝竟能安万国，衣裳端合会诸侯。\n小臣再拜涂山下，瞻望馀光在上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53683,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下蔡县","author":"汪广洋","text":"传闻下蔡开新邑，曾是当年古寿州。\n群岭坡陀围楚野，十城环璅控淮流。\n风云散尽豪华歇，狐?来游草木稠。\n落日临高倍惆怅，八公山远暮生愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53684,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过寿州望八公山有感","author":"汪广洋","text":"八公草木晚离离，彷佛成人似设奇。\n老气逼云含雾雨，空青拔地镇淮夷。\n谢玄归奏平戎日，王猛徒劳料敌时。\n淝水不关兴废事，夕阳西下浪声迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53685,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太和县","author":"汪广洋","text":"淮河西与蔡河接，八百里程无一家。\n废邑经年埋草莽，遗民何处梦桑麻。\n蝉声呜咽沿堤柳，狼迹纵横匝路沙。\n唯有伤心旧时物，毁垣高倚夕阳斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53686,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"许家窝","author":"汪广洋","text":"两堤削立数千仞，坡脚才晴见曝鼋。\n河水到湾喧去马，棹郎牵缆走惊猿。\n桑畦不辨芦花渚，麦陇翻成祗树园。\n若比舂陵凋瘵处，许家窝上更难言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53687,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"霸王城","author":"汪广洋","text":"重瞳往昔矜无敌，故垒於今只有名。\n大抵喑呜非帝德，由来宽厚合民情。\n皇风已荡妖氛气，阴雨犹闻鬼哭声。\n念此膏腴淮楚地，几时田畯劝农耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄河","author":"汪广洋","text":"发迹昆崙最上峰，汇流奔突势舂容。\n天关直下无留隘，地轴潜回有定踪。\n石激浪痕蹲虎豹，船经桑罅走蛟龙。\n欲求缩地忘惊险，正恐奇人不易逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"历下亭临眺","author":"汪广洋","text":"海子山头历下亭，旧时台榭倚空青。\n济南山水多佳丽，工部文章最典型。\n绕径落花风瑟瑟，隔窗啼鸟树冥冥。\n素琴拟待横秋月，看取游鱼夜出听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"趵突泉","author":"汪广洋","text":"济南泉有七十二，趵突泉当第一流。\n山谷幽深开虎穴，水心明白现鳌头。\n月升银海波涛涌，露湿金茎沆瀣浮。\n骑马远来閒洗耳，怕闻丝竹沸清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过故翰林李慨之天心水面亭遗址","author":"汪广洋","text":"供奉归来已浪游，大明湖上贮清秋。\n十千美酒倾山雨，半百閒身对海鸥。\n水面风生杨柳岸，天心月过藕花洲。\n自从烂醉吹箫去，谁解临亭汎夕流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王明府历下秋兴图","author":"汪广洋","text":"点缀秋容亦费思，芙蓉泉上晚晴时。\n景於佳处烦清赏，兴到无声绝有诗。\n天外好山来隐隐，云边归鸟去迟迟。\n更怜箕踞哦松者，多是长安杜拾遗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋用赠省中诸友","author":"汪广洋","text":"画戟森严粉署开，沛然灵雨洗氛埃。\n数峰晚翠云边出，万斛秋涛树杪来。\n齐鲁衣冠逢治日，国家文武萃英才。\n欲凭高处舒吟啸，还忆年时上凤台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅杖为西霞霍维肃赋","author":"汪广洋","text":"铮铮古干锵鸣铁，拄到西湖浅水涯。\n素质可能韬玉润，溜皮犹自著霜华。\n临风倚竹幽香在，和月敲门瘦影斜。\n一段阳春旧清致，等閒来伴老西霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬宣城俞用中兼贻郡守","author":"汪广洋","text":"闻君旅寓宣城日，绝似拾遗殊可怜。\n瘦蹇骑从官道侧，苦吟书遍草堂前。\n孤撑老气陵严武，特立贫交许郑虔。\n郡中况有贤知己，应是时时送酒钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诏下谕平幽蓟兼喜复唐时衣冠","author":"汪广洋","text":"日射卿云拥建章，内官催谒簉鹓行。\n已闻河朔平全蓟，更喜衣冠遇盛唐。\n露奏定随丹凤下，天书犹带紫泥香。\n朝回花底鸣珂佩，不特凌烟独有光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉旨行冬至朝贺礼","author":"汪广洋","text":"宝扇初开雉影圆，鸡人唱彻听胪传。\n两京云集千官拥，万国春从一气先。\n酒进玉杯承湛露，乐当金阙奏钧天。\n小臣际遇惭无补，愿拟南山颂万年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自寿","author":"汪广洋","text":"腐儒今年四十二，幸当尧舜圣明时。\n堂中白发慈亲健，膝下红颜二子奇。\n竹叶香浮春拍拍，棣花辉映日迟迟。\n寸心为国虽无补，不愧皇天后土知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅信","author":"汪广洋","text":"双江十月寻君处，记得巡檐索笑歌。\n往事依稀常在念，暗香消息近如何。\n閒凭南雁传冰雪，试扣东风向薜萝。\n来复定期当七日，政缘驿使寄声多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅魁","author":"汪广洋","text":"才听东风第一声，状元高出冠群英。\n冰霜岁月殊先得，桃李园林取次荣。\n春到玉堂传视草，香凝琼宴赐和羹。\n御沟杨柳含青眼，应许樊兄是老成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲阜县","author":"汪广洋","text":"狐?纵横走夕阳，断篱荒径入牛羊。\n可怜东鲁成焦土，曾是西周奠故疆。\n汶泗尚馀春寂寂，龟蒙遥对晚苍苍。\n偶披荆棘怀前古，独有弦歌思激扬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日过邳州","author":"汪广洋","text":"红日曈曈出海东，扶桑枝上晓云融。\n九农已兆三时业，万国均蒙一视同。\n原鸟飞鸣乘淑气，堤杨摇曳受和风。\n古邳城下河凌积，谁俾销沉顷刻中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜过宝应县","author":"汪广洋","text":"满湖风浪拍堤沙，雪压黄芦没钓槎。\n卧听隔船歌白苧，起来和月岸乌纱。\n故乡近别无多地，归梦应知己到家。\n何日弟兄携子侄，海天烟雨艺桑麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53704,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓过高邮喜乡人迎饯","author":"汪广洋","text":"贺监南归酒正香，一斑才露鬓毛苍。\n最怜倾盖逢知己，曾敢扬眉过故乡。\n风约冻云开野色，月兼晴雪动湖光。\n旧时亲友多零落，长是教人忆断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53705,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过河阴观楚汉遗垒","author":"汪广洋","text":"广武山前望虎牢，淡烟衰草没城皋。\n鸿沟岂限长江险，楚垒何如汉壁高。\n此日登临悲鸟道，当时南北混鲸涛。\n河阴老树森幢盖，犹似銮舆驻白旄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53706,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过杭州览古","author":"汪广洋","text":"浙江亭下水如苔，曲几閒窗面面开。\n山势不移天阙在，潮头偏逐海门来。\n梅从和靖祠前见，柳绕苏公堤上栽。\n知是国初全盛日，满城丝竹沸楼台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53707,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌行赠别一首","author":"汪广洋","text":"歌停云，酌春酒。\n送君发，为君寿。\n弹青萍，鼓素瑟。\n何以赠，双白璧。\n车儿膏，马儿秣。\n时载阳，鸣鸧鸹。\n戒仆夫，肃徂征。\n陟远道，扬飞旌。\n慰尔民，崇尔德。\n君子心，我无忒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53708,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采薇","author":"汪广洋","text":"采薇采薇，山高路危。\n采之盈掬，聊以充饥。\n薄暮无人，踽踽独归。\n其归伊何，路远莫致。\n焉得羽翰，乘风而去。\n念我母氏，怀我兄弟。\n日月遄迈，其如忧悴。\n翩彼晨风，集于丛木。\n载飞载鸣，载生载育。\n人故不能，而罹茕独。\n用作是歌，以写心曲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53709,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对竹","author":"汪广洋","text":"我家湖水上，长与竹为邻。\n今夜月明里，相看如故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53710,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挟弹图","author":"汪广洋","text":"宫树已闻莺，王孙挟弹行。\n金丸非爱惜，为尔好音声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53711,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写兴","author":"汪广洋","text":"彭蠡惊涛急，匡庐积翠重。\n东林潇洒地，只合卧云松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53712,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太华奇迹三首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"仙人白玉掌，半出五云间。\n好去寻芝草，移栽王屋山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53713,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太华奇迹三首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"华岳万年松，盘盂小可容。\n清泠一勺水，苍翠起蛟龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53714,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太华奇迹三首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"玉井落青天，天开五色莲。\n自从采华实，又是几千年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53715,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观后堂秋燕","author":"汪广洋","text":"喃喃若为语，栖栖犹恋巢。\n乌衣故乡近，好去莫辞劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53716,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"滩行逆上船，杨柳画桥边。\n正恐风湍急，劳将百丈牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53717,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"云壑生清籁，松萝挂紫烟。\n沿流待月出，徐放贺家船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53718,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"章贡水流急，舟行不觉寒。\n棹郎烟雨外，争折小桃看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53719,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其四","author":"汪广洋","text":"上滩如上天，曾买越溪船。\n倚棹閒追忆，於今第六年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其五","author":"汪广洋","text":"滩水粼粼碧，蒲芽短短青。\n仆夫忘记念，却道过严陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大港口","author":"汪广洋","text":"夜宿大港口，月林闻露蝉。\n稳抛船尾缆，莫近浅沙边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中渡河","author":"汪广洋","text":"薄雾寒容惨，残年归思多。\n南京亲舍远，冲雪过青河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过雁门有感","author":"汪广洋","text":"淋漓杯酒边，虎迹出龙泉。\n神物终呵卫，将门四百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53724,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五花涧","author":"汪广洋","text":"桑麻生暝烟，沙碛露晴雪。\n尽日不见人，凉蝉自呜咽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53725,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过池阳三首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"山空云气收，风定水声歇。\n双髯发短歌，轻舟荡斜月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53726,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过池阳三首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"放舟秋浦月，扬舲秋浦风。\n年年远行迈，往来秋浦东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53727,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过池阳三首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"每思贵池鱼，曾涉贵池水。\n美人不招来，松柏秋风起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53728,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行","author":"汪广洋","text":"溪光静如白练，山色碧似朝霞。\n最是一春好处，雨晴人采新茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53729,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴会清堂","author":"汪广洋","text":"胜日大开东阁，临池旋取鲜鳞。\n只为梅花合醉，不须风雨留人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53730,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"句曲山中","author":"汪广洋","text":"闻说昌阳可引年，便从句曲种秋烟。\n茅家兄弟如相识，赠我明珠百颗圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53731,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿宁国山家","author":"汪广洋","text":"夹路苍松锁暮霞，满溪流水带寒沙。\n荆扉不掩云长住，此是山中静者家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53732,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏溪亭","author":"汪广洋","text":"苏溪亭上草漫漫，谁倚东风十二阑。\n燕子不归春事晚，一汀烟雨杏花寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53733,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧归越中二首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"白下门前黄叶飞，楚人来送越僧归。\n遥知到日春初暖，应是霜林笋蕨肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53734,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧归越中二首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"越中旧识梁开士，说法曾无一语闻。\n惟有手培双树在，至今苍翠倚秋云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53735,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张巨源老人","author":"汪广洋","text":"毵毵素发仅垂领，落落老怀殊过人。\n七郡江山宛如故，有谁曾不受风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53736,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行三首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"前村后村溪水涸，大树小树梅花开。\n一双野鹤避人去，四壁云山傍马来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53737,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行三首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"米家图画不易得，今日见山如见之。\n偶上层峦纵游目，不知驻马已多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53738,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行三首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"曾闻东掖郎官说，七郡好山如米多。\n松风吹衣水流急，疑在王官谷里过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53739,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再过江阴观镏琪写竹","author":"汪广洋","text":"镏琪素得洋州谱，写竹真如写草书。\n尚忆澄江旧游地，雨中烧笋食鲥鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53740,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临溪桥 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"面面溪山小画图，山行不尽翠模糊。\n深林遗庙知谁祀，烟雨东风啼鹧鸪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53741,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临溪桥 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"临溪桥畔柳毵毵，桥下溪流碧似蓝。\n烟雨画图行七日，不知春梦绕江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53742,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临溪桥 其四","author":"汪广洋","text":"空谷无人响暗泉，隔溪茅屋见炊烟。\n东风故遣飞花出，知是桃源别有天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53743,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿宁国县","author":"汪广洋","text":"宁国城中听雨眠，元龙楼阁半青天。\n翻疑句曲山中夜，万壑松涛落枕边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53744,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游金华山三首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"空翠盘盘下鹤群，仙家鸡犬静中闻。\n东风忽遣廉纤雨，吹落松稍几片云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53745,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游金华山三首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"玄都静者学仙处，说在金华小洞天。\n偶忆骑鲸沧海去，石田瑶草自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53746,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游金华山三首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"湿雾空濛啼画眉，满山黄竹雨垂垂。\n隔溪乱石如羊白，想是初平去后遗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53747,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜过丛山关","author":"汪广洋","text":"山黑怕闻猿啸哀，关门鱼钥报重开。\n健儿把烛更深立，争道前年使客来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53748,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿井山废寺四首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"一井深藏数百家，半宜榛栗半宜茶。\n可怜兵后谁为主，唯有长松寄宿鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53749,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿井山废寺四首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"四壁云山拥翠屏，上方零落锁寒扃。\n祇缘丧乱无虚日，颠倒琅函贝叶经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53750,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿井山废寺四首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"涧水泠泠响石溪，旧时亭馆半高低。\n杜鹃尽有伤春泪，啼到山深不忍啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53751,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿井山废寺四首 其四","author":"汪广洋","text":"破屋哀哀啼老孀，祗因兵后又年荒。\n一家十口存无二，废尽门前陌上桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53752,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣城道中二首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"雨花台下承明发，尽日王维画里行。\n到此溪山愈幽绝，令人想见谢宣城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53753,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣城道中二首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"万壑长风吹老髯，轻云时送雨廉纤。\n暂停候馆拈春碧，爱杀春盘野荠甜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53754,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]